            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"parte-b\">Parte b</h1>\n<h2 id=\"inducao-x-times-y-z-a-times-b\">Indu\u00e7\u00e3o <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x \\times y + z = a \\times b||)</marimo-tex></h2>\n<h2 id=\"0-inducao\">0-Indu\u00e7\u00e3o</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Para todo o estado $<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\,x\\,||)</marimo-tex>$\n       (a) $<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\quad \\neg\\,P(x)\\quad||)</marimo-tex>$  \u00e9  inconsistente</span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1||)</marimo-tex>$-Indu\u00e7\u00e3o</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Para todo par de estados $<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\,x,y\\,||)</marimo-tex>$ deve-se verificar\n       (a) $<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\quad\\mathsf{init}(x)\\,\\land\\,\\neg P(x)\\quad||)</marimo-tex>$  \u00e9  inconsistente\n       (b) $<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\quad\\mathsf{trans}(x,y) \\,\\land\\, P(x)\\,\\land\\,\\neg\\,P(y)\\quad||)</marimo-tex>$ \u00e9 inconsistente</span>\n</blockquote></span>"
